From 70393a846f4a9439d1d4a42f69934d4b25976ed8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 08:01:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add last_verified tracking and a stale-listings screen
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Office admins need a way to see which active listings nobody has
confirmed are still on the market. Adds a last_verified column
(auto-set on create/duplicate, updated by a "Mark verified today"
button and a bulk action), a /properties/stale screen scoped like the
rest of the app (admins/managers see everything, agents see their own
plus unclaimed stock), and a stale badge on cards, table rows, and the
nav rail.

Also fixes a real permission gap found while in this file: the
registered delete_image route was missing the can_edit ownership
check that a dead, unreachable earlier definition of the same
function had — any signed-in agent could delete another agent's
listing photos.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01U3sgXu7uGRzpkyQXbzW1dC
